:03.026">来</span></p><p begin="1:05.027" end="1:09.963" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:05.027" end="1:05.865">是我</span><span begin="1:05.865" end="1:06.736">情绪</span><span begin="1:06.736" end="1:07.502">涌了</span><span begin="1:07.502" end="1:08.687">上</span><span begin="1:08.687" end="1:09.963">来</span></p><p begin="1:10.387" end="1:15.587" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:10.387" end="1:10.674">想</span><span begin="1:10.674" end="1:11.071">哭</span><span begin="1:11.071" end="1:11.873">却一</span><span begin="1:11.873" end="1:12.614">片</span><span begin="1:12.655" end="1:13.467">空</span><span begin="1:13.467" end="1:15.587">白</span></p></div><div begin="1:16.922" end="1:41.080" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:16.922" end="1:22.422" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.922" end="1:17.323">雪</span><span begin="1:17.323" end="1:17.921">地里相</span><span begin="1:17.921" end="1:18.287">爱</span> <span begin="1:18.287" end="1:19.024">他们说零</span><span begin="1:19.024" end="1:19.874">下已</span><span begin="1:19.874" end="1:20.183">结</span><span begin="1:20.183" end="1:20.557">晶</span><span begin="1:20.557" end="1:21.059">的誓言</span><span begin="1:21.059" end="1:21.477">不</span><span begin="1:21.477" end="1:21.642">会</span><span begin="1:21.642" end="1:22.422">坏</span></p><p begin="1:23.358" end="1:28.800" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="1:23.358" end="1:23.647">但</span><span begin="1:23.647" end="1:24.275">爱的状</span><span begin="1:24.275" end="1:24.658">态</span> <span begin="1:24.658" end="1:25.491">却不会永</span><span begin="1:25.491" end="1:25.877">远</span><span begin="1:25.877" end="1:26.292">都</span><span begin="1:26.292" end="1:26.478">冰</span><span begin="1:26.478" end="1:26.844">封</span><span begin="1:26.844" end="1:27.494">而透明</span><span begin="1:27.494" end="1:27.880">的</span><span begin="1:27.880" end="1:28.080">存</span><span begin="1:28.080" end="1:28.800">在</span></p><p begin="1:28.969" end="1:31.951" itunes: